# RAM-only Macro assignment -> source: change shape, navigate cards, edit rate,
# let quick feedback expire, then return through the same parent chain.
# Fixed 8.2-second musical use case; identical before and after each trial.
0 scenario bench-macro-v1
20 assert_view MACRO
100 transport start
180 button LEFT_BOTTOM down
260 tap MACRO_1 60
1300 button LEFT_BOTTOM up
1450 encoder_value NAV 0.010
1570 encoder_value NAV 0.010
1690 tap NAV 60
1930 assert_mode macro.modulation_editor
2030 tap NAV 60
2350 assert_mode project.modulator_detail
2400 marker shape_edit
2450 encoder_value OPT 0.750
2750 encoder_value OPT 0.250
3050 marker card_navigation
3100 encoder_value NAV 0.010
3400 encoder_value NAV 0.010
3700 encoder_value NAV 0.010
4000 encoder_value NAV -0.010
4300 encoder_value NAV -0.010
4600 marker focused_edit
4650 encoder_value OPT 0.250
4950 encoder_value OPT 0.750
5250 encoder_value OPT 0.500
6500 marker feedback_expired
6520 assert_mode project.modulator_detail
6700 tap LEFT_TOP 60
7000 assert_mode macro.modulation_editor
7200 tap LEFT_TOP 60
7500 assert_mode macro.edit
8000 transport stop
8200 marker done
